{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virus Brain is a game where you play as someone who has lost all their memories after a brain computer malfunction. Your past can be restored from a cloud backup, but only after upgrading your Brain Unit membership at a Brain Server station. To pay for the upgrade, you need to scavenge credit cards from corpses while encountering interesting characters and exploring the\u00a0abandoned town of Chidoyama.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virus Brain is a short horror puzzle platformer with a postmodern edutainment twist. As you solve puzzles, you\u2019ll also learn basic Japanese kanji, including numbers and directions. (No yellow paint included.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing casually will lead you to the default ending. But if you dig deeper, solve tougher puzzles, and uncover more secrets, you\u2019ll unlock the good ending.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059830?t=1760084369","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059830/fda65297ab77fe70dbd511f521a5da5da5c9bf81/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760084369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059830/4fae9be90e49f41bc61262dbac0615844c3524d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760084369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059830/4fae9be90e49f41bc61262dbac0615844c3524d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760084369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virus Brain is a game where you play as someone who has lost all their memories after a brain computer malfunction. Your past can be restored from a cloud backup, but only after upgrading your Brain Unit membership at a Brain Server station. To pay for the upgrade, you need to scavenge credit cards from corpses while encountering interesting characters and exploring the\u00a0abandoned town of Chidoyama.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virus Brain is a short horror puzzle platformer with a postmodern edutainment twist. As you solve puzzles, you\u2019ll also learn basic Japanese kanji, including numbers and directions. (No yellow paint included.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing casually will lead you to the default ending. But if you dig deeper, solve tougher puzzles, and uncover more secrets, you\u2019ll unlock the good ending.</p>","developers":["Vianite"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059830/c389ca2f0c1dae85c8ff687a81f4d4db99572ade/header.jpg?t=1760084369","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit distribution <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core, 2.5 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan-compatible GPU Intel UHD 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4059830/1320287595/d8203f10e81a27339d8cddf4a107f4f5dbed91e3/1759152174/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759850508","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4059830/1320287595/d8203f10e81a27339d8cddf4a107f4f5dbed91e3/1759152174/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759850508","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4059830/1320287595/d8203f10e81a27339d8cddf4a107f4f5dbed91e3/1759152174/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759850508","id":257208584,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.